{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Belvedere in the afternoon was tolerable, though the crowds were thick. At six, I joined the Partheys for the *Barber of Seville*. Lablache as Figaro is indeed spirited, though Fodor’s Rosina lacks breath. The audience clapped until the singers returned three times; I confess I found the repetition tedious, but the Partheys, at my urging, were enchanted. We paid two florins for the seats, a fair price for the noise. Dinner at the tavern was mediocre, and I have already complained to the waiter about the wine. I read the theatre paper’s notice, which praises the newcomer de Franco highly. I am tired. Kiss the boys for me, and tell Karl he must stop writing such long letters.\n\nYour devoted\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219358,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":1127,"total_tokens":1301,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-rQdthqwptRaFMeeqaT2WoZJmvadCd6KB","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1127,"prompt_ms":1066.653,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9464534161490683,"prompt_per_second":1056.576037380479,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4095.682,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.674462427745663,"predicted_per_second":42.239607469525225}}